Use Oidc\cOidcWellKnownHandler.pkg
Use Oidc\OidcDefaultProvider.wo
Use Oidc\OidcDefaultKeyStore.wo
Use Oidc\OidcDefaultHandler.wo

Object oOidcWellKnown is a cOidcWellKnownHandler
    Set phoOidcProvider         to oOidcDefaultProvider
    Set phoOidcKeyStore         to oOidcDefaultKeyStore
    Set phoOidcHandler          to oOidcDefaultHandler
End_Object
